OL,3,GNEWSAFather mown down and killed at
OL,4,ADiwali celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a father who was attacked
OL,8,Fwith an iron rod, mowed down by a car,
OL,9,Fand then run over again when the car
OL,10,Freversed.
OL,12,FNavpreet Singh, 26, had been
OL,13,Fcelebrating the last day of the
OL,14,FFestival of Diwali with friends at
OL,15,FWolverhampton's Phoenix Park in the
OL,16,Fearly hours of 22 October last year,
OL,17,Fwhen a fight broke out with another
OL,18,Fgroup.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
