OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFather mown down and killed at
OL,4,ADiwali celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe violence was led by Prabhjot Singh,
OL,7,F18, West Midlands Police said, and
OL,8,Fafter being attacked, Navpreet was
OL,9,Fdeliberately run over by 21-year-old
OL,10,FJashan Singh.
OL,12,FOn Monday at Wolverhampton Crown Court,
OL,13,FJashan Singh was found guilty of his
OL,14,Fmurder, while Prabhjot Singh previously
OL,15,Fadmitted violent disorder.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
